{"page":499,"width":1666,"height":2512,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"560","words":[{"text":"560","x":171,"y":145,"width":57,"height":28}]},{"text":"Chapter 12 입출력 시스템","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":297,"y":147,"width":114,"height":28},{"text":"12","x":424,"y":149,"width":35,"height":21},{"text":"입출력","x":488,"y":149,"width":61,"height":24},{"text":"시스템","x":558,"y":150,"width":62,"height":24}]},{"text":"서도 각 출력이 다른 프로그램의 출력과 섞이지 않게 프린터로 출력되기를 원할 것이다.","words":[{"text":"서도","x":301,"y":269,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"각","x":373,"y":269,"width":29,"height":34},{"text":"출력이","x":413,"y":270,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"다른","x":514,"y":270,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"프로그램의","x":585,"y":270,"width":144,"height":34},{"text":"출력과","x":744,"y":271,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"섞이지","x":847,"y":272,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"않게","x":948,"y":272,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"프린터로","x":1022,"y":272,"width":125,"height":34},{"text":"출력되기를","x":1161,"y":273,"width":164,"height":34},{"text":"원할","x":1338,"y":272,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"것이다.","x":1418,"y":272,"width":97,"height":35}]},{"text":"운영체제는 공공 프로그램으로부터 프린터로 기는 모든 출력을 가로챔으로써 이 문제를","words":[{"text":"운영체제는","x":298,"y":327,"width":153,"height":35},{"text":"공공","x":462,"y":327,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"프로그램으로부터","x":532,"y":327,"width":232,"height":35},{"text":"프린터로","x":780,"y":328,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"기는","x":914,"y":328,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"모든","x":985,"y":330,"width":62,"height":32},{"text":"출력을","x":1059,"y":329,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"가로챔으로써","x":1170,"y":329,"width":191,"height":34},{"text":"이","x":1379,"y":328,"width":27,"height":34},{"text":"문제를","x":1423,"y":329,"width":93,"height":35}]},{"text":"해결한다. 각 공공 프로그램의 출력은 각각 대응되는 보조저장장치 파일에 저장(스풀)된","words":[{"text":"해결한다.","x":299,"y":384,"width":127,"height":34},{"text":"각","x":441,"y":384,"width":29,"height":34},{"text":"공공","x":481,"y":384,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"프로그램의","x":551,"y":384,"width":144,"height":35},{"text":"출력은","x":710,"y":385,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"각각","x":811,"y":385,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"대응되는","x":883,"y":385,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"보조저장장치","x":1016,"y":385,"width":188,"height":35},{"text":"파일에","x":1221,"y":386,"width":95,"height":34},{"text":"저장(스풀)된","x":1334,"y":385,"width":180,"height":37}]},{"text":"다. 공공 프로그램이 출력 데이터 만들어내기를 끝내게 되면, 스풀링 시스템은 그때까지","words":[{"text":"다.","x":299,"y":442,"width":36,"height":34},{"text":"공공","x":349,"y":442,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"프로그램이","x":422,"y":441,"width":143,"height":34},{"text":"출력","x":581,"y":441,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"데이터","x":652,"y":442,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"만들어내기를","x":752,"y":442,"width":180,"height":35},{"text":"끝내게","x":944,"y":442,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"되면,","x":1050,"y":442,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"스풀링","x":1134,"y":442,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"시스템은","x":1247,"y":442,"width":130,"height":35},{"text":"그때까지","x":1389,"y":442,"width":123,"height":37}]},{"text":"모아 놓은 출력 데이터를 프린터 출력용 대기 열에 삽입한다. 스풀링 시스템은 큐에서","words":[{"text":"모아","x":297,"y":499,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"놓은","x":373,"y":500,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"출력","x":447,"y":499,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"데이터를","x":521,"y":499,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"프린터","x":652,"y":500,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"출력용","x":754,"y":500,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"대기","x":860,"y":500,"width":55,"height":36},{"text":"열에","x":936,"y":499,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"삽입한다.","x":1009,"y":499,"width":133,"height":35},{"text":"스풀링","x":1160,"y":500,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"시스템은","x":1277,"y":499,"width":130,"height":35},{"text":"큐에서","x":1422,"y":501,"width":90,"height":35}]},{"text":"대기 중인 스풀 파일을 한 번에 하나씩 프린터에 내보낸다. 어느 운영체제에서는 스풀링","words":[{"text":"대기","x":297,"y":556,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"중인","x":369,"y":557,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"스풀","x":440,"y":558,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"파일을","x":512,"y":557,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"한","x":611,"y":557,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"번에","x":653,"y":557,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"하나씩","x":723,"y":558,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"프린터에","x":823,"y":558,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"내보낸다.","x":957,"y":558,"width":129,"height":34},{"text":"어느","x":1103,"y":558,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"운영체제에서는","x":1178,"y":557,"width":232,"height":36},{"text":"스풀링","x":1422,"y":560,"width":90,"height":34}]},{"text":"은 시스템 디먼(daemon) 프로세스에 의해 관리된다. 다른 운영체제에서 스풀링은 커널","words":[{"text":"은","x":294,"y":614,"width":32,"height":34},{"text":"시스템","x":338,"y":615,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"디먼(daemon)","x":441,"y":615,"width":200,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스에","x":654,"y":616,"width":146,"height":36},{"text":"의해","x":815,"y":617,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"관리된다.","x":885,"y":616,"width":128,"height":35},{"text":"다른","x":1029,"y":616,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"운영체제에서","x":1102,"y":616,"width":192,"height":35},{"text":"스풀링은","x":1311,"y":616,"width":132,"height":34},{"text":"커널","x":1456,"y":616,"width":56,"height":35}]},{"text":"스레드에 의해 처리된다. 두 경우 모두 운영체제는 프린터에 대기 중인 작업을 열거하거","words":[{"text":"스레드에","x":294,"y":672,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"의해","x":429,"y":673,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"처리된다.","x":501,"y":672,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"두","x":636,"y":675,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"경우","x":679,"y":673,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"모두","x":748,"y":677,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"운영체제는","x":820,"y":674,"width":152,"height":36},{"text":"프린터에","x":983,"y":674,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"대기","x":1123,"y":674,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"중인","x":1198,"y":674,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"작업을","x":1278,"y":674,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"열거하거","x":1392,"y":674,"width":119,"height":37}]},{"text":"나 취소하거나 잠시 중단하는 제어 인터페이스를 제공한다.","words":[{"text":"나","x":293,"y":730,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"취소하거나","x":336,"y":730,"width":150,"hei